# The Game can be thought of as 2 modes: Overworld mode and Combat Mode

# The player has a deck of cards based on their items and abilities
# The player can equip armor or weapons
# The player can level up and unlock new abilities
# All Items and Abilities translate to cards that are in the players deck.
# Its good to have lots of varaibles and detail when modeling things. Think similar to Dungens and Dragons level complexity

# Each Mode has its own rules file to follow
    # `combat-mode.mdc`
    # `overworld-mode.mdc`

